* "American Lead V", channel 1 (modes Clean / Fat / Tweed), read from the drawing (MVPRE1/2/3.S01): V1A (the guitar's own copy of the shared input stage, on the channel 1 / 2
* plate load R4 100k + R4A 47k), the CH1 tone stack (fed straight from the plate through RYC1A; R6 82k with C3 .15u is a shunt to ground at its input), CH1 GAIN with C7 120p,
* R216 100k and R110 475k, V1B, the mode network of the relays RYM1 / RYM3B into V3A, then R68 47k and R67 150k into V3B with CH1 MASTER (100KA rheostat to ground at its grid),
* C108 and R140 22k into the output o1 (R189 8k2 with C112 250p to ground).
* The mode selector CH1 MODE sets the SW_* as the relays read: Clean (M1) R31 3M3 with C23 20p into V3A; Fat (M2) R32 2M2 with C23 and R33 680k to ground; Tweed (M3) the
* divider R30 475k / 500p over R34 3M3 / 180p (more level), J175M3 (47k at V3B's grid) and R199 10k at the output. R110 shunts the C7 / R216 path in Clean and Fat.
* Assumed: the GAIN pot's wiper reaches the output in every mode (the drawing leaves RYM3A's Clean / Fat contact unconnected, which would leave the knob without effect); V3A's
* JFET bypasses: Clean none, Fat C31 100u, Tweed C31 and C32; the CH1 BOLD switch (R98) is left open.

V VRAIL x 100 400
R R86 x dp 1k
C C87 dp 0 30u
I VIN gin 1
R RSRC gin in 7k
R RPU1 gin pkb1 1e12
.xfmr LPU1 L=2.5
  W pkb1 in 1 pu
.end
R RPU2 gin pkb2 1e12
.xfmr LPU2 L=5
  W pkb2 in 1 pu
.end
C CPU gin in 110p
R RPL gin in 1e12
R SWK1 in pkk1 1e12
C CCAB1 pkk1 0 200p
R SWK2 in pkk2 1e12
C CCAB2 pkk2 0 400p
R SWK4 in pkk4 1e12
C CCAB4 pkk4 0 800p



* V1A: 1M leak, 1k5 + 1k5 and 0.47u on the cathode, 15u (J175A), plate load R4 100k + R4A 47k.
R R1 in 0 1M
T V1A in p1 k1 12AX7
R R2 k1 n3 1.5k
R R3 n3 0 1.5k
C C1 k1 0 0.47u
C C2 k1 c2 15u
R SW_C2 c2 0 1
R R4 dp r4 100k
R R4A r4 p1 47k

* CH1 tone stack, straight from the plate: R6 82k with C3 .15u to ground, C4 250p to the treble pot, R7 100k to the node bn, C5 .1 and C6 .047 to the rheostats.
R R6 p1 r6 82k
C C3 r6 0 0.15u
C C4 p1 tt 250p
R R7 p1 bn 100k
C C5 bn bt 0.1u
C C6 bn mt 0.047u
R VRT_T tt w1 1
R VRT_B w1 bt 1
R VRBS bt mt 1
R VRMD mt 0 1

* CH1 GAIN (1MA) from the treble wiper, its wiper to the node z; C7 120p and R216 100k from the pot's top to z, R110 475k from their junction to ground (Clean, Fat).
R VRG_T w1 wg 1
R VRG_B wg 0 1
R RWG wg z 1
C C7 w1 y7 120p
R R216 y7 z 100k
R R110 y7 r110 475k
R SW_R110 r110 0 1

* V1B (100k plate, 1k5 with 0.47u), C20, R35 100k.
R RG1B z 0 10M
T V1B z p1b k1b 12AX7
R R27P dp p1b 100k
R R26 k1b 0 1.5k
C C19A k1b 0 0.47u
C C20 p1b v1o 0.047u
R R35 v1o 0 100k

* The mode network (RYM1, RYM3B): R31 3M3 (Clean) or R32 2M2 (Fat, Tweed) with C23 20p to the node nn, R33 680k to ground (Fat, Tweed); the divider R30 / R34 with its tap t2;
* V3A's grid takes nn (Clean, Fat) or t2 (Tweed); R42 475k (the reverb return) to ground.
R R31 v1o n31 3.3M
R SW_R31 n31 nn 1
R R32 v1o n32 2.2M
R SW_R32 n32 nn 1e12
C C23 v1o nn 20p
R R33 nn n33 680k
R SW_R33 n33 0 1e12
R R30 v1o t2 475k
C C22 v1o t2 500p
R R34 t2 0 3.3M
C C118 t2 0 180p
R SW_NN nn g3a 1
R SW_T2 t2 g3a 1e12
R R42 g3a 0 475k

* V3A (100k plate, R44 1k5, C31 100u / C32 2u2 by mode), C33, R68 47k and R67 150k to V3B's grid g3b: R129 47k, J175M3's 47k (Tweed) and CH1 MASTER (100KA rheostat).
T V3A g3a p3a k3a 12AX7
R R43 dp p3a 100k
R R44 k3a 0 1.5k
C C31 k3a c31 100u
R SW_C31A c31 0 1e12
C C32 k3a c32 2.2u
R SW_C32A c32 0 1e12
C C33 p3a u3 0.047u
R R68 u3 a3 47k
R R67 a3 g3b 150k
R R129 g3b 0 47k
R RJ3 g3b rj3 47k
R SW_J3 rj3 0 1e12
R VRMS_T g3b wm 1
R VRMS_B wm 0 1
R WM wm g3b 1

* V3B (120k plate, 1k with 15u), C108, R140 22k to o1 with R189 8k2 / C112 250p, and R199 10k (Tweed).
T V3B g3b p3b k3b 12AX7
R R138 dp p3b 120k
R R137 k3b 0 1k
C C89 k3b 0 15u
C C108 p3b u1 0.047u
R R140 u1 o1 22k
R R189 o1 0 8.2k
C C112 o1 0 250p
R R199 o1 r199 10k
R SW_R199 r199 0 1e12
